+  to a closed, outward-facing hull of 8 vertices / 12 triangles; collider transforms, primitive
+  shapes, filtering and full-scene coverage are not yet validated
+
+- player ground build: Ganglia alpha.13 supplies padded collision-to-surface tiles with profile
+  clearance, detail heights, slope and directed step seams. `player-ground` collects selected
+  physical inputs independently of factory AI exclusions. complex shapes, capsule axis
+  interpretation and complete prefab/state coverage remain gaps. real VL2 tile seams validate, while
+  its tested arrival route remains unresolved.
+
+- movement devices: `traversal-devices` exports authored rope targets, launch/acceleration parameter
